6.	Loops
Loops Kya Hotay Hain?
Loop ka matlab hota hai:
👉 “Ek hi kaam ko baar baar repeat karna”
Real Life Example
•	5 users create karne hain
•	100 logs check karne hain
•	10 servers pe same command chalani hai
👉 bar bar same code likhne ki zarurat nahi → loop use hota hai
 FOR LOOP
Concept
👉 Jab hume pehle se pata ho kitni dafa kaam karna hai
Script
#!/bin/bash

for i in 1 2 3 4 5
do
  echo "Number: $i"
done
Samajh
•	for i in 1 2 3 4 5
👉 i ki value 1 se 5 tak jayegi
•	echo "Number: $i"
👉 har value print hogi
Output
Number: 1
Number: 2
Number: 3
Number: 4
Number: 5
WHILE LOOP
Concept
👉 Jab tak condition TRUE hai tab tak repeat hota rahe
Script
#!/bin/bash

count=1

while [ $count -le 5 ]
do
  echo $count
  count=$((count+1))
done
Samajh
1️⃣
count=1
starting value
2️⃣
while [ $count -le 5 ]
👉 jab tak count 5 se chota ya equal hai
3️⃣
count=$((count+1))
👉 har loop ke baad 1 increase
Output
1
2
3
4
5
FOR vs WHILE
FOR LOOP	WHILE LOOP
fixed range	condition based
known times	unknown times
simple	Flexible
